flowchart TD
    A[Select reviewed opportunity] --> B[Read published material list]
    B --> C{Live provider ready and materials present?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Planning model orders explicit zero-based material indices]
    D --> E{Every original index exactly once?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Use validated order]
    E -->|No or call failure| G[Keep original source order and show Fallback]
    C -->|No| H[Keep original order without model call]
    F --> TASK[Build source-linked tasks using unchanged material text]
    G --> TASK
    H --> TASK
    TASK --> GEN[Add separately labeled general verification, cost and final-review steps]
    GEN --> SAVE[(SQLite: opportunity ID, checklist order and completion IDs)]
    SAVE --> UI[My plan: reload and check off tasks]
    UI --> SAVE
    UI --> EXPORT[Download JSON or Markdown]
    TASK --> DEP[Validate suggested dependencies and add preparation dates when a deadline is known]
    UI --> DRAFT[Edit and download provider, reference or nomination question drafts]
    UI --> CLEAR[Clear saved plans]
    CLEAR --> RETAIN[Budget ledger and stage logs remain]
